pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 120, 1100, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>方向03：Arm CCA / RME / RMM 基础架构</strong></p>
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 175, 1100, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>围绕 Realm、RME、RMM、granule ownership 与 lifecycle 建立 Arm CCA 主线</p>
  - elementId: content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 230, 1100, 420]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心问题：</strong>云场景下 host 仍需管理资源，但不应看到 tenant workload 数据。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px"><strong>三篇论文分工：</strong></p>
        <ul>
        <li><strong>Li 2022 CCA (E1)</strong>：开创/基础入口，OSDI 系统论文，提出 Realm、RME、RMM、GPT/GPC 与 lifecycle</li>
        <li><strong>Arm CCA 架构规范 (E0)</strong>：代表性改进，官方规范，定义 Realm model 和 standard evidence</li>
        <li><strong>Arm RMM 规范 (E0)</strong>：当前 SOTA/补充边界，官方规范，定义 Realm management 和 lifecycle</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:16px"><strong>证据等级：</strong>E1 为系统论文基础证据；E0 为官方规范标准材料；具体实现正确性需回验证和厂商证据。</p>
